# BOSS DEFEATED — plays when the Maw collapses (MawBoss.defeated_cutscene).

letterbox on
camera 5420 -420 1.1
wait 0.8
say mafia "...Is it gone?"
say fairy "Sealed. For now. Something sent it here."
say mafia "The Rift."
emote fairy "!"
say fairy "The terraces will heal. And you didn't hunt a single fairy."
say mafia "Day's not over yet."
give_shards 5
set_flag slice_complete
fade_out 1.0
narrate "To be continued..."
fade_in 1.0
camera_reset
letterbox off
